  measurementCount (cachedMapped2 cache0 cache1 (b0::b1::b2::b3::bs) (y0::y1::y2::y3::ys) (k0::k1::k2::ks) cin) := by
 have h:=cachedMapped2_counts cache1 cache2 b1 b2 b3 bs y1 y2 y3 ys k1 k2 ks k0
