 have hl : cachedMixed4 cache0 cache1 cache2 cache3 expected (b0::b1::b2::b3::b4::bs) (y0::y1::y2::y3::y4::ys) (d::false::false::false::false::fs) (k0::k1::k2::k3::ks) cin=
